> <ins>**WP3. River & Surface Flooding**</ins>
> **POLICY OBJECTIVE:** Develop high-quality global estimates of economic losses due to surface and river flooding from climate change, and study how zoning laws (understood broadly as local restrictions on population and capital growth) can mitigate future damages.
